    <briefdescription>
<para>PII Redaction Policy for Logs, Traces, and Metrics. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Central enforcement point that integrates PII detection with the observability pipeline (Logger, Tracer::Span::setAttribute, MetricsCollector labels).</para>
<para>Design goals:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Zero-configuration default: picks up config/pii_patterns.yaml automatically.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Enforce consistent redaction rules across all three telemetry channels.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Thread-safe singleton so it can be called from anywhere without explicit dependency injection.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Channels and behaviour:</para>
<para><table rows="6" cols="3"><row>
<entry thead="yes"><para>Channel  </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>Method  </para>
</entry><entry thead="yes"><para>Default mode  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para>Logs  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para><ref refid="classthemis_1_1security_1_1_p_i_i_redaction_policy_1afc32bcbfc50898dbb2e017e8b9a3c10f" kindref="member">redactForLog()</ref>  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>Replace every detected PII span with masked  </para>
</entry></row>
<row>
<entry thead="no"><para></para>
