<para>Usage: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Logs</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">std::string<sp/>safe_msg<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1security_1_1_p_i_i_redaction_policy_1afb1931c9a00046c405170136b93e74df" kindref="member">PIIRedactionPolicy::get</ref>().<ref refid="classthemis_1_1security_1_1_p_i_i_redaction_policy_1afc32bcbfc50898dbb2e017e8b9a3c10f" kindref="member">redactForLog</ref>(raw_message);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">THEMIS_INFO(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;{}&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>safe_msg);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Traces</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>safe_attrs<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1security_1_1_p_i_i_redaction_policy_1afb1931c9a00046c405170136b93e74df" kindref="member">PIIRedactionPolicy::get</ref>().<ref refid="classthemis_1_1security_1_1_p_i_i_redaction_policy_1ad7245be27fc142e7db1d3e13f5aa32b8" kindref="member">redactAttributes</ref>(span_attrs);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">span.setAttribute(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;user.info&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>safe_attrs[</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;user.info&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">]);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>Metrics</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>safe_labels<sp/>=<sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1security_1_1_p_i_i_redaction_policy_1afb1931c9a00046c405170136b93e74df" kindref="member">PIIRedactionPolicy::get</ref>().<ref refid="classthemis_1_1security_1_1_p_i_i_redaction_policy_1a4e9c333954902f024c558b1cceb3e5d5" kindref="member">redactLabels</ref>(metric_labels);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">MetricsCollector::getInstance().recordQuery(safe_labels[</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;type&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">],<sp/>latency,<sp/>count);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting></para>
<para>Configuration: The policy inherits all redaction modes from config/pii_patterns.yaml. Set the THEMIS_PII_STRICT environment variable to &quot;1&quot; to force strict (full-replace) redaction regardless of per-pattern configuration. </para>
